<title>SWITZERLAND: Novartis sees 1997 growth in all divisions.</title>
<headline>Novartis sees 1997 growth in all divisions.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss life sciences group Novartis AG expects to show growth in all its divisions in 1997, chief executive Daniel Vasella said.</p>
<p>&quot;Barring unexpected developments, all divisions should show growth in 1997,&quot; he told the annual shareholders meeting.</p>
</text>
